{"id":"u-f68dbbdb-3dec-4169-99b3-bf384c2c2375","src":"community","title":"Upper-Lower Routine with Wet Cardio & Mobility Day","author":"Brady Roudabush","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/ppbRgr-upper-lower-routine-with-cardio-and-mobility-day","desc":"This program is built for lifters who want to get stronger on the big barbell lifts without trashing their joints or recovery. It combines a simple upper–lower split with an easy ‘wet cardio’ and mobility day: relaxed pool swimming, focused freestyle drills, and joint‑friendly mobility work. On the swim day, you’ll use tools like a kickboard, one‑arm drills, and a pull buoy to dial in body position, breathing, and a smooth freestyle catch while keeping effort low and technique‑driven. The goal is to drive steady strength and muscle gains on 2×/week upper and 2×/week lower days while using low‑impact swim cardio to manage fatigue, improve work capacity, and keep you feeling good session to session. After lifting days, you can add 10–20 minutes of sauna or hot tub time, and after your wet cardio/mobility day you can take a 3–5 minute cold plunge, as optional recovery tools to help you relax and bounce back","level":["Novice","Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle","Athletics"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":7,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-08T16:41:15.319Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4","Day 5"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6,"x":2}]},{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6,"x":2}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Hammer Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets"